Homes that have been left for a while often collect more than one fault in a single visit. They can share one list and one visit when they are on the same site. That costs less than a separate call for every tap. When the repair needs it, Rakeeza links light debris removal or a clean-up after cutting and opening, so the work waste does not stay in the middle of the house.

